        "created_at": "2022-11-07T19:36:22.633Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Is there a way to create macros from the official character sheet?</p>\n<p>I see in the image that is given as an example that they have a “power suit” and the dice to roll for that ability on the top left. Is there a way to create that?</p>\n<p>The community sheet has a way to put a check next to each ability, but I didn’t see a way to pull the powers from a database like the official sheet does. It would be rather cumbersome to type in all the abilities for each character.</p>\n<p>Thanks for the help and any other tips for running a game on Roll20.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2022-11-07T19:36:22.633Z",
